  "notes": "Schooling is compulsory from 5 to 16 (Education Ordinance 2008); Nursery and Reception (Early Years Foundation Stage) come before Year 1. The only secondary school, Prince Andrew School, was renamed St Helena Secondary School in May 2025. GCSEs are taken in Year 11 and A levels in Year 13. Ascension and Tristan da Cunha are not covered."
